DSA – 45 million: average monthly active recipients of the service in the Union  
DMA – 45 million: monthly active end users of a core platform service in the Union  

DMA additionally requires:  
- at least 10 000 yearly active business users of the same core platform service in the Union;  
- the core platform service must be provided in at least three Member States;  
- the 45 million and 10 000 thresholds must have been met in each of the last three financial years.
